summary.label:
Fretboard app is a roadmap for guitar. Use it at practice sessions to improve your fretboard visualisation.

Features:
- Most popular guitar scales (pentatonic, major, minor, modes of major scale), arpeggios;
- Three display modes for each scale: degrees, notes, dots;
- Change root note to practice scale in different key;
- Zoom in and out to display as many positions of a scale as you need, even display entire fretboard;
- CAGED positions.
